## X-Elmira-Class: PALADIN
## Version: @project-version@

# Data before Register.lua: Register.lua reads ns.Data.SoD at file scope and returns early if it is
# absent, so any file listed after it would be loaded but never handed to core.
# Spells before Sets/Souls: nothing enforces that ordering today, but the bonus tables reference
# spell keys and reading them in dependency order keeps a future guard honest.
Data\Spells.lua
Data\Sets.lua
Data\Souls.lua
Data\Timing.lua
Data\Catalog.lua
Data\Advice\Paladin.lua
Data\Builds\Paladin_Exodin.lua

Register.lua
